<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5662] Primary index name should contain type ID or name</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5662</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, the primary index name contains neither type ID nor type name. Since metadata storage allocates tree root based on the index name, two different indexes will be using the same index tree.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Attached test reproduces this issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A correct fix would be to include type ID or type name (depends on the current SQL internals) to the index name.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
